+q(0)q(0)+q(1)q(1)}\\cdot q(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\sum }_{i\\in {-1,0,1}}(5{t}^{2}-5){|}_{t=i}\\cdot (t+1){|}_{t=i}}{{\\sum }_{i\\in {-1,0,1}}(t+1){|}_{t=i}\\cdot (t+1){|}_{t=i}}\\cdot (t+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{0\\cdot 0+(-5)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 2}{0\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 2}\\cdot (t+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{-5}{5}\\cdot (t+1) \\\\  & =-t-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe distance between $p(t)=5{t}^{2}-5$ and the subspace spanned by $q(t)=t+1$ with respect to our inner product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =‖p(t)-{\\text{proj}}_{q(t)}\\,p(t)‖ \\\\  & =‖5{t}^{2}-5-(-t-1)‖ \\\\  & =‖5{t}^{2}+t-4‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{⟨5{t}^{2}+t-4,5{t}^{2}+t-4⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨5{t}^{2}+t-4,5{t}^{2}+t-4⟩ & ={\\sum }_{i\\in {-1,0,1}}(5{t}^{2}+t-4){|}_{t=i}\\cdot (5{t}^{2}+t-4){|}_{t=i} \\\\  & =(0)\\cdot (0)+(-4)\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =0+16+4 \\\\  & =20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distance is $d=\\sqrt{20}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375654 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375655 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375657 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375658 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186375658 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375653 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b5eb4129-4179-5cad-b537-5964562a2c96" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375654 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{10}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375654 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375654 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "69984854-c740-507d-a2b8-fdb5e8a42fe6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375655 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{